1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:01,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 8=

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,000
Hua.

6
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,399
What are you doing here?

7
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:20,879
You had an allergic reaction.

8
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:21,920
I was worried.

9
00:00:26,359 --> 00:00:26,879
Don't touch me.

10
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:30,559
Hua,

11
00:00:31,559 --> 00:00:33,159
I really didn't mean
to let you get hurt like that.

12
00:00:33,359 --> 00:00:34,960
Li Sirong says she didn't know
you were allergic to mango.

13
00:00:35,159 --> 00:00:35,719
Gu Zheng,

14
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:37,679
you should know best
that I'm allergic to mango.

15
00:00:38,359 --> 00:00:39,479
She says she didn't know.

16
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:40,840
Do you believe her?

17
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:43,560
Hua.

18
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:45,840
Don't come see me unless necessary.

19
00:00:58,640 --> 00:00:59,920
I had Fen make you some chicken soup.

20
00:01:00,439 --> 00:01:00,960
Drink up.

21
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,560
Maybe in a bit.

22
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:11,920
Mr. Gu,

23
00:01:12,959 --> 00:01:14,280
thanks for coming,

24
00:01:15,159 --> 00:01:15,920
but she needs her rest.

25
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:16,959
Mr. Xie,

26
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,239
you're not even family.

27
00:01:19,239 --> 00:01:20,159
I'm her husband.

28
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,040
Mr. Gu,

29
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:25,480
you heard him.

30
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,079
So what if you're her husband?

31
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,719
Lin Hua doesn't love you.

32
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:33,640
Hua, tell him.

33
00:01:34,319 --> 00:01:35,760
You married him just to spite me,

34
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:36,719
didn't you?

35
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:53,879
It hurts.

36
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:54,920
Careful.

37
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,680
♪I stand at the crossroads♪

38
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,200
♪Waiting for your answer♪

39
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,799
You can go now, Mr. Gu.

40
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,280
We'd like some time to ourselves.

41
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:09,240
♪Holding flowers about to wilt♪

42
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:12,400
♪The tears never fell♪

43
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:17,400
♪Opening a fairy tale under the covers♪

44
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:24,520
Mr. Xie,

45
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:26,120
well...

46
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:27,520
I'm sorry.

47
00:02:27,719 --> 00:02:30,520
I just wanted Gu Zheng to leave, so...

48
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:32,120
It's okay.

49
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,199
I understand.

50
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,159
Wait.

51
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:51,120
Here.

52
00:02:58,840 --> 00:02:59,760
♪Closer to you♪

53
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:02,000
♪Like stars falling into my dreams♪

54
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:04,280
♪All my cautious little gestures♪

55
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,600
♪You make me certain♪

56
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:07,720
♪I like you♪

57
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:10,080
♪Every breath draws me toward you♪

58
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,680
♪If fate could speak♪

59
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:14,840
♪It must mean I was meant to meet you♪

60
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,760
♪Closer to you♪

61
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:21,240
♪Closer to you♪

62
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:29,360
♪You're the joy I just can't hide♪

63
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,759
Your husband is so attentive.

64
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:34,000
♪If rain falls from a sunny sky♪

65
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:35,760
♪I'll tilt my umbrella toward you♪

66
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,840
♪If your courage ever fails♪

67
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,960
♪I'll walk beside you, step by step♪

68
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:42,280
♪Love isn't about possession♪

69
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:16,120
Did you

70
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,319
sit here all night?

71
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,680
Mr. Xie,

72
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:32,720
you don't have to do all this for me.

73
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:33,480
I...

74
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,319
You're my responsibility.

75
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,839
Not because of our agreement.

76
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:38,519
Because I...

77
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,439
because I want to.

78
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:00,240
I'll get us some breakfast.

79
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,279
What would you like?

80
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,360
Some tofu pudding.

81
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:06,920
Okay.

82
00:05:12,879 --> 00:05:13,279
Wait for me.

83
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:21,560
(What did he mean by that?)

84
00:05:22,399 --> 00:05:24,720
(Is he serious about me?)

85
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:34,160
(Jiang A66688)

86
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,240
What are you doing here?

87
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:42,000
I was worried.

88
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:50,639
(You're my responsibility.)

89
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,240
(Not because of our agreement.)

90
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,439
(Because...)

91
00:05:58,720 --> 00:05:59,839
(because I want to.)

92
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,000
Mr. Xie.

93
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:10,199
Yes?

94
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:12,480
What you said this morning...

95
00:06:14,639 --> 00:06:15,560
did you mean it?

96
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:17,560
I did.

97
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,079
Then how

98
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,199
do you really feel about me?

99
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,000
Do you want the truth?

100
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,000
When you're ready,

101
00:06:38,759 --> 00:06:39,399
I'll tell you.

102
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:46,240
You always do this.

103
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:48,160
You only tell me half the story.

104
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:08,900
♪You say you♪

105
00:07:08,900 --> 00:07:10,920
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

106
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:14,320
♪You're just fine on your own♪

107
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:17,480
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

108
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:20,480
♪And the pain you face at night♪

109
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:24,160
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

110
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:27,320
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

111
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:30,400
♪Some love needs no promises♪

112
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:33,760
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

113
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:36,440
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

114
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:39,680
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

115
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:42,640
♪I'm right behind you♪

116
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:46,160
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

117
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:48,800
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

118
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:52,800
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

119
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:59,000
♪I'm right behind you♪

120
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,880
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

121
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,720
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

122
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:05,160
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

123
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,720
♪I'm right behind you♪

124
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:09,080
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

125
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:10,840
♪I won't claim you♪

126
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:12,520
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

127
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:15,200
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

128
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:18,560
♪Waiting for you♪
